an class=\"fn\">A</span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\">A</span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"`d` with `t - z₀ - z₂` added to its limbs from `o + k` to `o + n - 1`, where `z₀` is in limbs\n`[o, o + 2 k)` and `z₂` in `[o + 2 k, o + n)`: Karatsuba's middle term, in one pass over the window\nof `t`. Outside `midOK` it writes the value of its specification.","docLink":"./MPN/Toom/Mid.html#MPN.WordArray.midW","kind":"def","line":256,"name":"MPN.WordArray.midW","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-mpn/blob/0c3e72656c98060de12dca90ae58fec3c9765095/MPN/Toom/Mid.lean#L256-L276"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./MPN/Toom/Mid.html#MPN.WordArray.midStep\"><span class=\"name\">MPN</span>.<span class=\"name\">WordArray</span>.<span class=\"name\">midStep</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">A</span> : <a href=\"./foundational_types.html\">Type</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">L</span> : <a href=\"./foundational_types.html\">Type</a>}</span></span> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">[<span class=\"fn\">LA</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./MPN/LimbArray.html#MPN.LimbArray\">LimbArray</a> <span class=\"fn\">A</span> <span class=\"fn\">L</span></span>]</span></span> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">[<span class=\"fn\">R</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./MPN/WordArray.html#MPN.WordArray\">WordArray</a> <span class=\"fn\">A</span> <span class=\"fn\">L</span></span>]</span></span> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">d</span> : <span class=\"fn\">A</span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">vo </span><span class=\"fn\">yo </span><span class=\"fn\">zo </span><span class=\"fn\">len </span><span class=\"fn\">ny </span><span class=\"fn\">nz</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#USize\">USize</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">hv</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./MPN/WordArray.html#MPN.WordArray.LoopBound\">LoopBound</a> <span class=\"fn\">d</span> <span class=\"fn\">vo</span> <span class=\"fn\">len</span></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">hy</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./MPN/WordArray.html#MPN.WordArray.LoopBound\">LoopBound</a> <span class=\"fn\">d</span> <span class=\"fn\">yo</span> <span class=\"fn\">ny</span></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">hz</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./MPN/WordArray.html#MPN.WordArray.LoopBound\">LoopBound</a> <span class=\"fn\">d</span> <span class=\"fn\">zo</span> <span class=\"fn\">nz</span></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">i</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#USize\">USize</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">hi</span> : <span class=\"fn\">i</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#LT.lt\">&lt;</a> <span class=\"fn\">len</span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">x </span><span class=\"fn\">c</span> : <span class=\"fn\">L</span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\">L</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Prod\">×</a> <span class=\"fn\">L</span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Limb `i` of the window: `d[vo + i] + x - y - z` plus the carry `c - 2`, where `y` is limb `yo + i`\nof `d` below `ny` and `0` after, and `z` limb `zo + i` below `nz`, by `addDiffC`.","docLink":"./MPN/Toom/Mid.html#MPN.WordArray.midStep","kind":"def","line":216,"name":"MPN.WordArray.midStep","sourceLink":"https: